{"articleNo":"3120","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_01.do?mode=view&articleNo=3120&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"2012학년도 1학기 사랑드림장학금 신청안내","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2012.01.19","hit":"11221","attachments":[{"name":"2012학년도 1학기 사랑드림장학금 학생신청 매뉴얼.hwp","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_01.do?mode=download&articleNo=3120&attachNo=2710"}],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<!--StartFragment-->&nbsp;\n<p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;휴먼엑스포&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 18pt\">2012학년도 1학기 사랑드림장학금 신청안내</span></p>\n<p style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;휴먼명조,한컴돋움&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">2012학년도 1학기 사랑드림장학금 신청안내를 다음과 같이 하오니 해당 학생들은 기간 내에 신청해 주시기 바랍니다.</span></p>\n<p style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;휴먼명조,한컴돋움&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;1. 신청기간 : 2012. 01. 19(목) ~ 01. 31(화) 18:00까지</span></p>\n<p style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;휴먼명조,한컴돋움&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;2. 신청대상 :&nbsp;가, 나 모두 해당되는 학생<br>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 가.&nbsp;아래에 해당하는 본인 또는 자녀<br></span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;휴먼명조,한컴돋움&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;- 학생가장(아동복지시설 출신자 포함)</span></p>\n<p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;휴먼명조,한컴돋움&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;- 산재근로자(1∼7급) 가정</span></p>\n<p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;휴먼명조,한컴돋움&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; - 한부모 가정</span></p>\n<p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;휴먼명조,한컴돋움&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; - 장애인 가정(장애등급 : 1∼3등급)</span></p>\n<p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;휴먼명조,한컴돋움&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; - 다문화 가정</span></p>\n<p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;휴먼명조,한컴돋움&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; - 북한이탈주민 가정<br>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 나. 유형3(블리자드)<br>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; - 현재 국내 4년제 대학 1학기 이상 이수 및 잔여학기가 2학기 이상인 자<br>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; - 공학계열 관련 학과(부)생 우대</span></p>\n<p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;휴먼명조,한컴돋움&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;3. 성적기준</span></p>\n<p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;휴먼명조,한컴돋움&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;- 직전학기 이수학점 12학점이상, 평점폄균 3.5이상</span></p>\n<p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 130%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;휴먼명조,한컴돋움&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;4. 추천인원 : 1명<br><br>&nbsp;&nbsp;5. 장학금액 : 등록금 전액</span></p>\n<p style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;휴먼명조,한컴돋움&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;6. 신청방법 : [붙임]</span></p>\n<p style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;휴먼명조,한컴돋움&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;7. 서류제출 : 한국장학재단 팩스(02-3419-8832)로 송부</span></p>\n<p style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;휴먼명조,한컴돋움&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;※ 서류제출마감일 : 2012. 02. 03(화) 18:00까지</span></p>\n<p style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;휴먼명조,한컴돋움&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">&nbsp;&nbsp;8. 문의 : 한국장학재단 홈페이지(</span><a href=\"http://www.kosaf.go.kr/\" target=\"_self\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;휴먼명조,한컴돋움&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><font color=\"#0000ff\">www.kosaf.go.kr</font></span></a><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;휴먼명조,한컴돋움&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">) <font color=\"#0000ff\">(T.1666-5114)<br></font>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 학생처 478-7065</span></p>\n<p style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\" class=\"HStyle0\">&nbsp; </p>\n<p style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;휴먼명조,한컴돋움&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\">붙임&nbsp; 2012학년도 1학기 사랑드림장학금 학생신청 메뉴얼 1부.</span></p>\n<p style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><br></span></p>\n<p style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"></span></p>\n<p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;휴먼명조,한컴돋움&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 16pt\">2012. 01. 19.</span></p>\n<p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center; MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\" class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;휴먼명조,한컴돋움&quot;; FONT-SIZE: 16pt\">학&nbsp;&nbsp; 생&nbsp;&nbsp; 처</span><span style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-SIZE: 12pt\"><br></span></p>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n            "}
